OL,5,G0130 Charles Paris: A Deadly Habit
OL,6,     F1/4. 4 Extra Debut. Charles
OL,7,     Freluctantly takes a theatre job
OL,8,     Fplaying a monk, and a murder
OL,9,     Finevitably follows. Stars Bill
OL,10,     FNighy.
OL,11,G0200 Yes Minister
OL,12,     F3/8. Jim Hacker gets the better of
OL,13,     FSir Humphrey over a crisis in
OL,14,     FDerbyshire. Adapted from BBC TV
OL,15,     Fwith Paul Eddington. From 1984.
OL,16,G0230 The Goon Show
OL,17,     F14/14. Neddie Seagoon converts the
OL,18,     Ffamous London landmark into a
OL,19,     Fspaceship. Stars Harry Secombe and
OL,20,     FSpike Milligan. From 1958.
